{"meta":{"stage":"06-mirror-prs","source_org":"cyberfabric","target_org":null,"first_run_at":"2026-06-01T10:25:05Z","last_run_at":"2026-06-01T10:25:05Z"},"stats":{"total":291,"synced":0,"pending":0,"failed":0},"items":[{"source_pr_number":591,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/591","source_state":"open","source_author":"Gregory91G","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #591] fix(identity): log JSON renders @m with substituted values (#590)","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"fix-identity-rendered-log-message","pr_head_sha":"56326f952ad55f251dad1c087d0c4093b21763a8","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"Gregory91G","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/591","id":3770506713,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7gvV3Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/591","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/591.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/591.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/591","number":591,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(identity): log JSON renders @m with substituted values (#590)","user":{"login":"Gregory91G","id":17801775,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODAxNzc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17801775?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G","html_url":"https://github.com/Gregory91G","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Switch the Serilog Console sink from `CompactJsonFormatter` to `RenderedCompactJsonFormatter` (same `Serilog.Formatting.Compact` namespace — no new dependency).\n- The new formatter emits `@m` (rendered message with placeholders substituted) **in addition to** `@mt` (template) and the structured properties. Machine-readable pipelines unchanged.\n\nCloses #590.\n\n## Before → After (same `GET /health` request)\n\nBefore:\n```json\n{\"@t\":\"…\",\"@mt\":\"HTTP {RequestMethod} {RequestPath} responded {StatusCode} in {Elapsed:0.0000} ms\",\"RequestPath\":\"/health\",\"RequestMethod\":\"GET\",\"StatusCode\":200,\"Elapsed\":0.217861, …}\n```\n\nAfter:\n```json\n{\"@t\":\"…\",\"@m\":\"HTTP \\\"GET\\\" \\\"/health\\\" responded 200 in 761.9250 ms\",\"RequestPath\":\"/health\",\"RequestMethod\":\"GET\",\"StatusCode\":200,\"Elapsed\":761.925, …}\n```\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Local rebuild + smoke against dev MariaDB (port-forward 18084). Logged `GET /health` line now carries `@m` with substituted values; structured properties intact.\n- [x] Unit + integration suites untouched by the change (formatter-only).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated request logging output format to display substituted placeholder values in log messages.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/591?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-29T17:21:54Z","updated_at":"2026-05-30T09:45:39Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c46bfb367716ca4619e9ee59ff43d0413bab3c90","assignees":[{"login":"Gregory91G","id":17801775,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODAxNzc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17801775?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G","html_url":"https://github.com/Gregory91G","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":10647699554,"node_id":"LA_kwDORRWv8s8AAAACeqcAYg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/labels/component:identity-service","name":"component:identity-service","color":"7B1FA2","default":false,"description":"Identity Service"}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/591/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/591/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/591/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/c