/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T13:43:31Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T14:25:47Z","body":"<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<details>\n<summary>ℹ️ Recent review info</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⚙️ Run configuration</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: defaults\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Free\n\n**Run ID**: `cdddb121-754b-4127-8fd8-d7e934d8633c`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between a2dc318b2f658d893818118ec577c4bd84ec0a54 and 7d3bf72e2d00507fc7b77c3772ec789f9e6811a9.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (4)</summary>\n\n* `docs/components/backend/identity-resolution/identity/specs/ADR/0014-last-admin-protection.md`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/SubchartService.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/Sql.Roles.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/SubchartEndpointTests.cs`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Files skipped from review due to trivial changes (3)</summary>\n\n* src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/SubchartService.cs\n* docs/components/backend/identity-resolution/identity/specs/ADR/0014-last-admin-protection.md\n* src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/Sql.Roles.cs\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nDocs and comments clarify lock-then-update last-admin protection; subchart SQL now conditionally emits roots and deterministically selects latest observations; integration tests and a MariaDB fixture change validate endpoint behaviors and shorten lock-wait failures.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Documentation & Testing Updates for Last-Admin Protection and Subchart Behavior**\n\n| Layer / File(s) | Summary |\n|---|---|\n| **Last-Admin Protection: Lock-Based Concurrency Strategy** <br> `docs/components/backend/identity-resolution/identity/specs/ADR/0014-last-admin-protection.md`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Api/Endpoints/PersonRolesEndpoints.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/RolesRepository.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/Sql.Roles.cs` | ADR, endpoint, repository, and SQL comments describe the lock-then-update pattern: acquire X-locks on active admins (`SqlRoles.LockActiveAdminsInTenantForUpdate`) in a RepeatableRead transaction, then perform a guarded UPDATE; notes explain non-admin revoke behavior, rollback semantics, and a concurrent-revoke test expectation (one 204, one 422). |\n| **Subchart Query & Service Documentation** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/SubchartService.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/Sql.Subchart.cs`, `docs/components/backend/identity-resolution/identity/specs/PRD.md` | `GetSubchart` SQL now conditionally emits the root only if present, uses `value_effective`/`value_ext` for latest observations with deterministic ROW_NUMBER() tie-break (`p.id DESC`), final pivot reads from `value_ext`; SubchartService docs and PRD error precedence note updated. |\n| **Integration Test Infrastructure & Subchart Validation** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/MariaDbFixture.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/SubchartEndpointTests.cs` | MariaDbFixture sets `--innodb-lock-wait-timeout=5`; three new SubchartEndpointTests validate missing caller header (401 + `caller_unresolved`), observation-backed fields appear in `root` for `depth=0`, and phantom self UUID returns 404 + `person_not_found`; `InsertOneAsync` test helper added. |\n\n## Sequence Diagram\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant Client\n  participant PersonRolesEndpoint\n  participant RolesRepository\n  participant MariaDB\n  Client->>PersonRolesEndpoint: DELETE /person-roles (revoke)\n  PersonRolesEndpoint->>RolesRepository: TrySoftDeletePersonRoleProtectingLastAdminAsync\n  RolesRepository->>MariaDB: BEGIN (RepeatableRead)\n  RolesRepository->>MariaDB: SqlRoles.LockActiveAdminsInTenantForUpdate (SELECT ... FOR UPDATE)\n  MariaDB->>RolesRepository: X-locks on active admin rows\n  RolesRepository->>MariaDB: guarded UPDATE (soft-delete) using locked state\n  alt update affected 1 row\n    MariaDB->>RolesRepository: success\n    RolesRepository->>Client: 204 No Content\n  else update affected 0 rows\n    MariaDB->>RolesRepository: 0 rows (last-admin protection)\n    RolesRepository->>Client: 422 Unprocessable Entity\n  end\n```\n\n## Estimated Code Review Effort\n\n🎯 2 (Simple) | ⏱️ ~12 minutes\n\n## Poem\n\n> A rabbit hops through docs so bright,  \n> Where locks now guard against the night,  \n> Queries bloom with roots held tight,  \n> Tests race in containers set to light,  \n> Observations surface, safe in sight! 🐰✨\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4534731766/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai","html_url":"https://github.com/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"coderabbitai","description":"# Transforming Code Reviews with AI\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n**Automated Reviews**: Continuous reviews of the pull 