ull/489","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/489.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/489.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/489","number":489,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"docs(connector-manager): add PRD/DESIGN/ADRs for credential & connect…","user":{"login":"cyberantonz","id":270971350,"node_id":"U_kgDOECax1g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270971350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberantonz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"…or management service\r\n\r\nNew service spec layered on the airbyte-toolkit module: a Rust service that owns connector credential storage (envelope-encrypted in MariaDB) and Airbyte source lifecycle, replacing the K8s-Secret + reconcile-bash credential path.\r\n\r\n- PRD-connector-manager: actors, FRs (catalog, credential CRUD, idempotency, rotation modes, error semantics, offboard), NFRs, API surface, risks\r\n- DESIGN-connector-manager: 7-crate Rust layout, UUIDv7 PKs, sea-orm storage, envelope encryption with kek_version-tracked DEK rows, internal reconcile loop with bounded ticks, offboard state machine with per-source 404 crypto-shred predicate, KEK delivery via tmpfs (not env-var), security context + RBAC denial of pods/exec, NetworkPolicy boundary, webhook delivery semantics, OpenAPI + descriptor secret-scanning policy\r\n- ADR-0014: Connector Manager service replaces K8s-Secret credential path (supersedes ADR-0003)\r\n- ADR-0015: KEK rotation via chunked re-wrap with resumable kek_version\r\n- ADR-0016: Hybrid sync/async semantics with compromise-rotation carve-out\r\n- ADR-0017: HTTP error envelope uses modkit-canonical-errors RFC 9457 Problem Details\r\n- ADR-0003: marked superseded-by 0014\r\n\r\nCypilot validation: all artifacts pass deterministic gate.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n## Release Notes\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Introduced comprehensive specifications for a new Connector Manager service featuring encrypted credential storage, tenant credential lifecycle management, and secure offboarding\n  * Documented architectural decisions covering credential rotation procedures, operation semantics, and standardized error handling\n  * Marked previous credential management approach as superseded\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/489?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-18T16:41:36Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T16:42:27Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"21b7d6eee25d7c6a117d4b878c7d9b897c56d4c5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/489/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/c