Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":600,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/600","source_state":"closed","source_author":"mitasovr","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #600] chore(release): umbrella 0.1.34 (toolbox image rebuild)","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"chore-release-0.1.34","pr_head_sha":"6519b33593aeece44075546bd749f433ad457d2b","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"mitasovr","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/600","id":3774797370,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7g_tY6","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/600","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/600.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/600.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/600","number":600,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(release): umbrella 0.1.34 (toolbox image rebuild)","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\nManual replay release (CI image builds still halted) — **toolbox image-only bump**.\n\nShips #599 (reconcile catalog-drift refresh on every pass). reconcile runs from the toolbox image, so it was rebuilt from `main@a0d6298`.\n\n- **Toolbox**: `ghcr.io/cyberfabric/insight-toolbox:2026.05.30.19.58-a0d6298`\n\n## Bumps\n- `charts/insight/values.yaml` — `ingestion.toolboxImage` → `...:2026.05.30.19.58-a0d6298`\n- `charts/insight/Chart.yaml` — `version 0.1.33 → 0.1.34` (appVersion unchanged)\n- `docs/deploy/.insight-version` — `0.1.33 → 0.1.34`\n\n## Notes\n- `Chart.lock` untouched. Umbrella **already published** to OCI: `oci://ghcr.io/cyberfabric/charts/insight:0.1.34` (digest `sha256:11a32ccc…`).\n\n## Why\nWith #599 baked in, the 15-minute reconcile loop now drift-checks each connection's catalog every pass and self-heals stale catalogs (e.g. after a connector schema change) without a manual discover+update — closing the last manual step in the #585→#599 HubSpot CRM fix thread.","created_at":"2026-05-30T20:02:22Z","updated_at":"2026-05-30T20:02:53Z","closed_at":"2026-05-30T20:02:52Z","merged_at":"2026-05-30T20:02:52Z","merge_commit_sha":"7746f023a82a10a7df67ec325aea7a8d534ca489","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/600/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/600/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-i