olbox image bump for release 0.1.33** <br> `charts/insight/Chart.yaml`, `charts/insight/values.yaml`, `docs/deploy/.insight-version`|Helm chart version incremented from 0.1.32 to 0.1.33, toolbox image tag updated to newer build (2026.05.30.19.30-2247504), and version documentation file synchronized to 0.1.33.|\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 1 (Trivial) | ⏱️ ~3 minutes\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 A version bumps with steady hand,\n> Toolbox tags across the land,\n> Charts aligned in perfect sync,\n> Release 0.1.33 in a blink!\n> ✨\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4584156939/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai","html_url":"https://github.com/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"coderabbitai","description":"# Transforming Code Reviews with AI\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n**Automated Reviews**: Continuous reviews of the pull requests including incremental commits. \r\n\r\n**Summarization**: Generates high-level summary and a technical walkthrough of the PR changes. \r\n\r\n**Line-by-line review**: Provides line-by-line suggestions committable with one click.\r\n\r\n**Codebase verification**:  Verifies the impact on the overall codebase and identifies missing changes.\r\n\r\n**Insights into your code**:  Ask any questions on your codebase within the pull request \r\n\r\n**Chat about your code** : Chat with the bot around your code. The more you chat, the smarter it gets.\r\n\r\n**Issue Validation**:  Validates the PR against the linked issues and identifies other related issues \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","external_url":"https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=cr_app&utm_medium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":597,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/597","source_state":"closed","source_author":"mitasovr","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #597] fix(reconcile): force fresh discover (disable_cache) on catalog refresh","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"fix/reconcile-discover-disable-cache","pr_head_sha":"adcae7761f315333c66e0417354f3a63f639b0a4","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"mitasovr","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/597","id":3774718552,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7g_aJY","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/597","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/597.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/597.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/597","number":597,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(reconcile): force fresh discover (disable_cache) on catalog refresh","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\nAfter a connector **image-only bump** that adds properties to a stream schema (e.g. #594/#595 adding deal `amount_in_home_currency` + `hs_acv/tcv/arr`), reconcile re-pins the Airbyte definition and calls `reconcile_refresh_catalog` → `ab_discover_schema` → `ab_update_connection_sync_catalog`. But the new fields **never reached the connection's `sync_catalog`**, so syncs didn't pull them and the bronze columns never appeared. dbt then keeps failing with `UNKNOWN_IDENTIFIER` on those columns.\n\n## Root cause\n`ab_discover_schema` posted `disable_cache:false`:\n\n```bash\nbody=$(printf '{\"sourceId\":\"%s\",\"disable_cache\":false}' \"${source_id}\")\n```\n\nAirbyte caches the discovered catalog keyed by **source config**, not by connector image tag. On an image-only bump the source config is unchanged, so the cached discover returns the **old** schema. reconcile then writes that stale catalog back to the connection — the new fields are silently dropped. (The Airbyte UI's own periodic schema detection *does* see them, hence the pending 'new fields' indicator, while reconcile's cached discover stays blind. It's also racy: whether the fix lands depends on the discover cache TTL — which is why #585's engagement fields eventually appeared but #594's deal fields did not.)\n\n## Fix\n- `ab_discover_schema` gains an optional `disable_cache` arg (default `false` — preserves the documented contract for any other use).\n- Both reconcile call sites that run after a definition/image change — the republish **catalog refresh** and the **bootstrap-create** discover — pass `true`, forcing a fresh discover so newly-advertised fields land in `sync_catalog`.\n\n## Validation\n`bash -n` passes on both files. Behavioural fix verified against the dev symptom: HubSpot deal fields were stuck out of the connection catalog despite the rebuilt connector image being pinned.\n\nPart of the #585 → #587 → #594 → #595 HubSpot CRM thread; this is the systemic reason those image bumps didn't auto-propagate new fields.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n## Release Notes\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved schema discovery to ensure fresh catalog when sources or connectors are updated, preventing stale field/stream information.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Bumped chart version to 0.1.32.\n  * Updated toolbox infrastructure image to latest build.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/597?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-30T19:25:07Z","updated_at":"2026-05-30T19:28:38Z","closed_at":"2026-05-30T19:28:38Z","merged_at":"2026-05-30T19:28:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"22475043c43eb3ec6a1da3fe32a1d237770fa775","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/597/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/597/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/597/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/statuses/adcae7761f315333c66e0417354f3a63f639b0a4","head":{"label":"mitasovr:fix/reconcile-discover-disable-cache","ref":"fix/reconcile-discover-disable-cache","sha":"adcae7761f315333c66e0417354f3a63f639b0a4","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/user