,"pr_head_owner":"mitasovr","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/596","id":3774680473,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7g_Q2Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/596","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/596.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/596.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/596","number":596,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(release): umbrella 0.1.32 (toolbox image rebuild)","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\nManual replay release (CI image builds still halted) — **toolbox image-only bump**, no chart template changes.\n\nFollows #595 (hubspot CDK descriptor re-pin to the connector image carrying #594's deal property fix). The toolbox image bakes the connector descriptors, so it was rebuilt from `main@8313687` to carry the patched `descriptor.yaml`.\n\n- **Toolbox**: `ghcr.io/cyberfabric/insight-toolbox:2026.05.30.19.03-8313687` (digest `sha256:9719e0b7…`)\n\n## Bumps\n- `charts/insight/values.yaml` — `ingestion.toolboxImage` → `...:2026.05.30.19.03-8313687`\n- `charts/insight/Chart.yaml` — `version 0.1.31 → 0.1.32`. `appVersion` unchanged (`2026.05.29.19.00-cc3c63a`) — toolbox is an ingestion value, not a subchart.\n- `docs/deploy/.insight-version` — `0.1.31 → 0.1.32`\n\n## Notes\n- `Chart.lock` untouched. Umbrella **already published** to OCI: `oci://ghcr.io/cyberfabric/charts/insight:0.1.32` (digest `sha256:8c91a637…`).\n\n## Why\nShips the rebuilt toolbox so reconcile re-pins HubSpot to the connector image that syncs `amount_in_home_currency` + `hs_acv/tcv/arr`. After deploy + full re-sync + `dbt --full-refresh tag:hubspot+`, `silver.class_crm_deals` finally builds and the CRM gold views / deal-based dashboard metrics (Velocity & Quality, Deal Flow) resolve.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated the toolbox component to a newer version.\n  * Released a new version of the insight chart with updated components.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/596?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-30T19:06:17Z","updated_at":"2026-05-30T19:06:41Z","closed_at":"2026-05-30T19:06:41Z","merged_at":"2026-05-30T19:06:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"a7e9356f72af265b05f7ac3e006f06aae44085dc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/596/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/596/comments","review_comment_url"