arized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4583990677/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai","html_url":"https://github.com/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"coderabbitai","description":"# Transforming Code Reviews with AI\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n**Automated Reviews**: Continuous reviews of the pull requests including incremental commits. \r\n\r\n**Summarization**: Generates high-level summary and a technical walkthrough of the PR changes. \r\n\r\n**Line-by-line review**: Provides line-by-line suggestions committable with one click.\r\n\r\n**Codebase verification**:  Verifies the impact on the overall codebase and identifies missing changes.\r\n\r\n**Insights into your code**:  Ask any questions on your codebase within the pull request \r\n\r\n**Chat about your code** : Chat with the bot around your code. The more you chat, the smarter it gets.\r\n\r\n**Issue Validation**:  Validates the PR against the linked issues and identifies other related issues \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","external_url":"https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=cr_app&utm_medium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":595,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/595","source_state":"closed","source_author":"mitasovr","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #595] chore(descriptors): bump hubspot CDK image (deal amount_home + acv/tcv/arr)","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"chore/bump-hubspot-descriptor-deals","pr_head_sha":"a744013dd86a077fcb07c746d2ab93fd96045f12","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"mitasovr","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/595","id":3774670702,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7g_Odu","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/595","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/595.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/595.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/595","number":595,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(descriptors): bump hubspot CDK image (deal amount_home + acv/tcv/arr)","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\nRe-pins the HubSpot CDK connector to the image rebuilt from #594 (adds `amount_in_home_currency` + `hs_acv/hs_tcv/hs_arr` to the deals property allowlist).\n\n- **Image**: `ghcr.io/cyberfabric/source-hubspot-insight:2026.05.30.18.54-885b1e2` (built on native amd64 host, digest `sha256:dd1dd22e…`)\n- `descriptor.yaml`: `images.cdk.image` → new tag; `version` minor bump `2.0.0 → 2.1.0`\n\n## Note on version\nCDK connectors emit `bump_kind=patch` regardless of `descriptor.version` (ADR-0015 §bump-kind storage scope) — reconcile republishes the definition + re-discovers the catalog (so the new deal columns appear), but does **not** auto-dispatch `dbt --full-refresh`. The historical backfill is run explicitly after deploy (full re-sync + `dbt run --full-refresh --select tag:hubspot+`).\n\n## Chain\n#585 → #587 (image/descriptor) → #594 (this property gap) → **this** (rebuilt image/descriptor). After merge: rebuild toolbox + umbrella release → deploy → resync → dbt full-refresh → `silver.class_crm_deals` builds → CRM gold views resolve → sales dashboard deal metrics light up.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/595?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-30T19:01:11Z","updated_at":"2026-05-30T19:02:08Z","closed_at":"2026-05-30T19:02:08Z","merged_at":"2026-05-30T19:02:08Z","merge_commit_sha":"8313687a61dc6e1c6aada25f85cf08057849c873","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/595/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/595/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/595/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/statuses/a744013dd86a077fcb07c746d2ab93fd96045f12","head":{"label":"mitasovr:chore/bump-hubspot-descriptor-deals","ref":"chore/bump-hubspot-descriptor-deals","sha":"a744013dd86a077fcb07c746d2ab93fd96045f12","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_u