: `ccbe74de-d23b-44ca-959d-f1dbdea70b01`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between 31cb0257432e5f22e5ec6f22114c6f84efdba1da and afcc296939f287f4c7e0675e2e81fae0732c31e1.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (1)</summary>\n\n* `src/ingestion/connectors/crm/hubspot/source_hubspot/constants.py`\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nThe HubSpot connector's property allowlist for deal objects is expanded to include three revenue-focused fields: `hs_acv`, `hs_tcv`, and `hs_arr`. These properties are added to the existing curated set of deal properties that are permitted to flow through the data pipeline.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Deal Properties Configuration**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|---|---|\n|**Deal properties allowlist expansion** <br> `src/ingestion/connectors/crm/hubspot/source_hubspot/constants.py`|The `deals` entry in `ALLOWED_PROPERTIES_BY_OBJECT` is modified to add `hs_acv`, `hs_tcv`, and `hs_arr` to the curated allowlist alongside existing `dealstage`, `dealtype`, and `hs_` deal status properties.|\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 2 (Simple) | ⏱️ ~8 minutes\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 Three new properties hop into the fold,  \n> Revenue metrics, stories yet untold,  \n> ACV, TCV, ARR so fair,  \n> Deal data richer, flowing with care! ✨\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</