edium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":592,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/592","source_state":"closed","source_author":"mitasovr","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #592] chore(release): umbrella 0.1.30 (toolbox image rebuild)","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"chore-release-0.1.30","pr_head_sha":"8683d344d1c385c2190bbefdd91213f74b003ca2","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"mitasovr","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/592","id":3770885437,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7gwyU9","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/592","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/592.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/592.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/592","number":592,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(release): umbrella 0.1.30 (toolbox image rebuild)","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\nManual replay release (CI image builds still halted) — **toolbox image-only bump**, no chart template changes.\n\nFollows #587 (hubspot CDK descriptor MAJOR bump). The toolbox image bakes the connector descriptors (`COPY . /ingestion`), and reconcile reads them from inside that image — so toolbox was rebuilt from `main@b8721ae` to carry the patched `descriptor.yaml` (new image ref + `version: 2.0.0`). This release re-pins the chart at the rebuilt toolbox.\n\n- **Toolbox**: `ghcr.io/cyberfabric/insight-toolbox:2026.05.29.15.22-b8721ae` (index digest `sha256:43b07cb1…`)\n\n## Bumps\n- `charts/insight/values.yaml` — `ingestion.toolboxImage` → `...:2026.05.29.15.22-b8721ae`\n- `charts/insight/Chart.yaml` — `version 0.1.29 → 0.1.30`. `appVersion` unchanged (`2026.05.29.10.50-0e0542d`) — it tracks the MAX of the four subchart appVersions; toolbox is an ingestion value, not a subchart.\n- `docs/deploy/.insight-version` — `0.1.29 → 0.1.30`\n\n## Notes\n- Subcharts (api-gateway / analytics-api / identity / frontend) keep their current appVersions/images.\n- `Chart.lock` untouched (`helm dependency update` re-resolved to identical versions/digests).\n- Umbrella chart **already published** to OCI: `oci://ghcr.io/cyberfabric/charts/insight:0.1.30` (digest `sha256:4ac7cbb0…`), since CI publish-chart is halted.\n\n## Why\nShips the rebuilt toolbox so reconcile sees the major-bumped hubspot descriptor and triggers `dbt --full-refresh` — required for the new `hs_created_by_user_id` property (#585) to backfill into bronze and rebuild the CRM silver/gold views feeding the sales dashboard (Velocity & Quality / Outreach Activity / Deal Flow).\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n## Release Notes\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Version bumped to 0.1.30.\n  * Updated internal tooling dependencies.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/592?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-29T18:35:27Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T18:36:35Z","closed_at":"2026-05-29T18:36:35Z","merged_at":"2026-05-29T18:36:35Z","merge_commit_sha":"b332ac3eea9c34753358ad3383ba09993e63cc1f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/592/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/592/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/592/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/statuses/8683d344d1c385c2190bbefdd91213f74b003ca2","head":{"label":"mitasovr:chore-release-0.1.30","ref":"chore-release-0.1.30","sha":"8683d344d1c385c2190bbefdd91213f74b003ca2","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr