other related issues \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","external_url":"https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=cr_app&utm_medium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":589,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/589","source_state":"closed","source_author":"cyberantonz","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #589] feat(chart): unify tenant_default_id under global.tenantDefaultId","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"tenant-alignment","pr_head_sha":"d45eef978fab9e16d8fc1309785ca06b86c7981a","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"cyberantonz","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/589","id":3770023422,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7gtf3-","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/589","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/589.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/589.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/589","number":589,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(chart): unify tenant_default_id under global.tenantDefaultId","user":{"login":"cyberantonz","id":270971350,"node_id":"U_kgDOECax1g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270971350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberantonz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Three places in the chart pinned a single-tenant default UUID:\r\n\r\n  * api-gateway `single-tenant-tr-plugin.tenants[0].id` (configmap template, literally hardcoded — no values knob)\r\n  * `IDENTITY__identity__tenant_default_id` env var (from `identity.tenantDefaultId`)\r\n  * `ANALYTICS__metric_catalog__tenant_default_id` env var (from `analyticsApi.tenantDefaultId`)\r\n\r\nThese three are SUPPOSED to be the same UUID — they describe the same concept: \"which tenant does this single-tenant install run as?\". On Virtuozzo we hit production caller-resolution 401s because all three referenced different UUIDs (chart hardcode + two unset values that operators had to remember to set, but separately).\r\n\r\nCollapse the three into ONE knob: `global.tenantDefaultId`. Helm propagates `global.*` to all subcharts automatically, so the api-gateway subchart's configmap template reads\r\n`.Values.global.tenantDefaultId` directly (with the original UUID preserved as a fallback for standalone-subchart users who don't go through the umbrella).\r\n\r\nRemoved the per-service `analyticsApi.tenantDefaultId` and `identity.tenantDefaultId` from `charts/insight/values.yaml`. The two umbrella secrets.yaml templates now read `global.tenantDefaultId`. Empty value = multi-tenant mode (gateway uses hardcoded fallback, identity + analytics-api emit no `*_tenant_default_id` env → strict caller-must-send-header behaviour).\r\n\r\nOperator change (release notes for the next umbrella version):\r\n  - Move any `identity.tenantDefaultId: <uuid>` / `analyticsApi. tenantDefaultId: <uuid>` settings to `global.tenantDefaultId: <uuid>` in values overlays.\r\n\r\nRender-tested both branches: with `global.tenantDefaultId=687e2215-…` all three places emit that UUID; with it unset, api-gateway falls back to the chart's hardcode and the two service env vars are absent.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/589?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-29T15:51:27Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T08:18:34Z","closed_at":"2026-05-29T15:52:55Z","merged_at":"2026-05-29T15:52:55Z","merge_commit_sha":"60d32737d692cb6574372e9ac484e4bb79f59920","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/589/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/589/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/589/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/statuses/d45eef978fab9e16d8fc1309785ca06b86c7981a","head":{"label":"cyberantonz:tenant-alignment","ref":"tenant-alignment","sha":"d45eef978fab9e16d8fc1309785ca06b86c7981a","user":{"login":"cyberantonz"