{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/589/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/statuses/d45eef978fab9e16d8fc1309785ca06b86c7981a"}},"author_association":"MEMBER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},"source_issue_comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4577184556","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/589#issuecomment-4577184556","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/589","id":4577184556,"node_id":"IC_kwDORRWv8s8AAAABENJLLA","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T15:51:39Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T15:52:13Z","body":"<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<details>\n<summary>ℹ️ Recent review info</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⚙️ Run configuration</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: defaults\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Free\n\n**Run ID**: `c359db9c-f3ba-439c-acae-c51b3c70b836`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between b8721aec2c6a5ffee3cacf08b71b40a59dfe3a11 and d45eef978fab9e16d8fc1309785ca06b86c7981a.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (3)</summary>\n\n* `charts/insight/templates/secrets.yaml`\n* `charts/insight/values.yaml`\n* `src/backend/services/api-gateway/helm/templates/configmap.yaml`\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nThis PR consolidates tenant default ID configuration from per-component Helm values to a single global value. A new `global.tenantDefaultId` is introduced as the authoritative source, with templates for analytics, identity, and API gateway services updated to reference it instead of their local values.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Tenant Default ID Consolidation**\n\n| Layer / File(s) | Summary |\n|---|---|\n| **Global tenant default ID contract and documentation** <br> `charts/insight/values.yaml` | Introduces `global.tenantDefaultId` as the unified single-tenant UUID fallback with full documentation of its usage across subcharts and services. Per-component documentation in `analyticsApi` and `identity` sections updated to indicate default-tenant sourcing from the global value. |\n| **Analytics and identity service configuration templates** <br> `charts/insight/templates/secrets.yaml` | Updates `ANALYTICS__metric_catalog__tenant_default_id` and `IDENTITY__identity__tenant_default_id` emissions to resolve from `global.tenantDefaultId` (with safe defaults and conditional rendering) instead of component-scoped values. |\n| **API gateway tenant configuration template** <br> `src/backend/services/api-gateway/helm/templates/configmap.yaml` | Computes the `single-tenant-tr-plugin` tenant ID from `global.tenantDefaultId` with fallback to a fixed default UUID and inline documentation of cross-subchart shared-tenant behavior. |\n\n## Sequence Diagram\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant HelmValues as charts/insight/values.yaml\n    participant SecretsTemplate as secrets.yaml Template\n    participant GatewayTemplate as api-gateway configmap.yaml Template\n    participant AnalyticsConfig as Analytics API Config\n    participant IdentityConfig as Identity Config\n    participant GatewayConfig as API Gateway Config\n    \n    HelmValues->>HelmValues: Define global.tenantDefaultId\n    SecretsTemplate->>HelmValues: Read global.tenantDefaultId\n    SecretsTemplate->>AnalyticsConfig: Emit ANALYTICS__metric_catalog__tenant_default_id\n    SecretsTemplate->>IdentityConfig: Emit IDENTITY__identity__tenant_default_id\n    GatewayTemplate->>HelmValues: Read global.tenantDefaultId\n    GatewayTemplate->>GatewayConfig: Compute single-tenant-tr-plugin id\n```\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 2 (Simple) | ⏱️ ~10 minutes\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 A tenant ID once scattered wide,  \n> Now gathers global, unified—  \n> One value rules them all so bright,  \n> From gateway down to service light! ✨\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4577184556/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai","html_url":"https://github.com/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"coderabbitai","description":"# Transforming Code Reviews with AI\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n**Automated Reviews**: Continuous reviews of the pull requests including incremental commits. \r\n\r\n**Summarization**: Generates high-level summary and a technical walkthrough of the PR changes. \r\n\r\n**Line-by-line review**: Provides line-by-line suggestions committable with one click.\r\n\r\n**Codebase verification**:  Verifies the impact on the overall codebase and identifies missing changes.\r\n\r\n**Insights into your code**:  Ask any questions on your codebase within the pull request \r\n\r\n**Chat about your code** : Chat with the bot around your code. The more you chat, the smarter it gets.\r\n\r\n**Issue Validation**:  Validates the PR against the linked issues and identifies other related issues \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","external_url":"https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=cr_app&utm_medium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":587,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/587","source_state":"closed","source_author":"mitasovr","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #587] chore(descriptors): bump hubspot CDK image + MAJOR version (force dbt full-refresh)","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"chore/bump-hubspot-descriptor","pr_head_sha":"52e5373ccaebf9078f7f8e1df6eff7f9c94524e5","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"mitasovr","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/587","id":3769786100,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7gsl70","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/587","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/587.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/587.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/587","number":587,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(descriptors): bump hubspot CDK image + MAJOR version (force dbt full-refresh)","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\nManual replay of the CI `build-image` + `bump-descriptors` steps for the **HubSpot CDK connector** (CI image builds still halted), with a **MAJOR** version bump to force a dbt full-refresh.\n\n#585 changed connector code (`source_hubspot/constants.py` — added `hs_created_by_user_id` to the property allowlist). That code ships in the connector's own image `source-hubspot-insight`, which Airbyte runs to sync HubSpot → bronze. So the connector image must be rebuilt and the descriptor re-pinned.\n\n## What was done (as CI does)\n- **Built + pushed** `ghcr.io/cyberfabric/source-hubspot-insight` (context = connector dir, `./Dockerfile`, `linux/amd64`):\n  - `2026.05.29.14.36-e60cf1f` (build_tag from merged commit `e60cf1f`) + `latest`\n  - index digest `sha256:185b070a…`\n- **Patched `descriptor.yaml`** (this PR):\n  - `images.cdk.image` → `...:2026.05.29.14.36-e60cf1f`\n  - `version` **MAJOR** bump `1.0.0 → 2.0.0`\n\n## Why MAJOR (not the usual minor)\nCI's `bump-descriptors` does a *minor* bump, which per ADR-0015 stays **below** the threshold that dispatches `dbt --full-refresh`. Here a full refresh is **required**:\n- The connector now fetches a **new property** (`hs_created_by_user_id`). Incremental/append bronze streams won't backfill it onto existing rows — only a full refresh re-syncs history with the new column.\n- The dbt incremental staging models (`hubspot__crm_deals` / `hubspot__crm_activities`) need a rebuild to add the column and reprocess.\n\nA MAJOR bump makes reconcile classify this as a breaking change and dispatch the full refresh on next deploy.\n\n## Root cause (context)\nThe CRM dbt staging models reference `properties_hs_created_by_user_id`, but the connector never synced it → `bronze_hubspot.deals`/engagements lacked the column → dbt staging failed → `silver.class_crm_*` / `insight.crm_*` gold views never built → analytics-api returned `UNKNOWN_TABLE` for the sales dashboard metrics (Velocity & Quality / Outreach Activity / Deal Flow).\n\n## Notes\n- CI normally commits this straight to `main`; opened as a PR since CI is halted.\n- After merge: reconcile re-registers the CDK source at the new tag and (due to the major bump) triggers `dbt --full-refresh`; the HubSpot full re-sync then lands `hs_created_by_user_id` in bronze.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated HubSpot connector to version 2.0.0 and refreshed its runtime image for improved reliability and compatibility.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/587?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-29T15:07:34Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T15:21:41Z","closed_at":"2026-05-29T15:21:41Z","merged_at":"2026-05-29T15:21:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"b8721aec2c6a5ffee3cacf08b71b40a59dfe3a11","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/587/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/587/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/587/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/statuses/52e5373ccaebf9078f7f8e1df6eff7f9c94524e5","head":{"label":"mitasovr:chore/bump-hubspot-descriptor","ref":"chore/bump-hubspot-descriptor","sha":"52e5373ccaebf9078f7f8e1df6eff7f9c94524e5","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1237641969,"node_id":"R_kgDOScTq8Q","name":"cyber-insight","full_name":"mitasovr/cyber-insight","private":true,"owner":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mita