","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"mitasovr","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/586","id":3769707525,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7gsSwF","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/586","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/586.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/586.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/586","number":586,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(release): umbrella 0.1.29 (toolbox image rebuild)","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\nManual replay release (CI image builds still halted) — **toolbox image-only bump**, no chart template changes.\n\n- **Toolbox**: `ghcr.io/cyberfabric/insight-toolbox:2026.05.29.14.36-e60cf1f` — rebuild against merged #585 (`fix(hubspot): sync hs_created_by_user_id for deals and engagements`).\n\n## Bumps\n- `charts/insight/values.yaml` — `ingestion.toolboxImage` → `...:2026.05.29.14.36-e60cf1f`\n- `charts/insight/Chart.yaml` — `version 0.1.28 → 0.1.29`. `appVersion` unchanged (`2026.05.29.10.50-0e0542d`) — it tracks the MAX of the four **subchart** appVersions, and toolbox is an ingestion value, not a subchart.\n- `docs/deploy/.insight-version` — `0.1.28 → 0.1.29`\n\n## Notes\n- Subcharts (api-gateway / analytics-api / identity / frontend) keep their current appVersions/images.\n- `Chart.lock` untouched (`helm dependency update` re-resolved to identical versions/digests).\n- Image verified to exist in GHCR (`linux/amd64`, digest `sha256:3abf30e3…`).\n- Umbrella chart **already published** to OCI: `oci://ghcr.io/cyberfabric/charts/insight:0.1.29` (digest `sha256:884f7376…`), since CI publish-chart is halted.\n\n## Why\nThe CRM gold views (`insight.crm_*`) feeding the sales dashboard (Velocity & Quality / Outreach Activity / Deal Flow) were failing with `UNKNOWN_TABLE` because the dbt staging models referenced `properties_hs_created_by_user_id`, a HubSpot property the connector allowlist never synced. #585 added it to the allowlist; this release ships the rebuilt toolbox image carrying that dbt change.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Released version 0.1.29\n  * Updated toolbox image to the latest version\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/586?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-29T14:53:40Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T14:54:15Z","closed_at":"2026-05-29T14:54:15Z","merged_at":"2026-05-29T14:54:15Z","merge_commit_sha":"097e665c70c6599ee827e78831c43f586c9bcd8a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"