.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/585","id":3769573855,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7gryHf","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/585","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/585.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/585.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/585","number":585,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(hubspot): sync hs_created_by_user_id for deals and engagements","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\n\nThe CRM sales-rep dashboard metrics — **Velocity & Quality**, **Outreach Activity**, **Deal Flow** — error out in `analytics-api` with ClickHouse **Code 60 (UNKNOWN_TABLE)**: the gold views `insight.crm_kpis`, `insight.crm_bullet_rows`, `insight.crm_chart_flow` don't exist.\n\n### Root cause (traced end-to-end on dev-vhc)\n\nThe sales-rep dashboard pipeline (`0a53f8bf`) added staging models `hubspot__crm_deals` and `hubspot__crm_activities` that select `properties_hs_created_by_user_id` (used for the per-activity-type attribution: calls→owner, emails/meetings/tasks→creator). But `hs_created_by_user_id` was **never added** to the connector's `ALLOWED_PROPERTIES_BY_OBJECT` allowlist.\n\nConsequences, confirmed on the dev cluster:\n\n1. Airbyte never fetches the property → column absent from `bronze_hubspot.deals` and all `engagements_*` tables.\n2. dbt run fails on both staging models — ClickHouse **Code 47 (UNKNOWN_IDENTIFIER)** on `properties_hs_created_by_user_id`.\n3. `silver.class_crm_*` models → **SKIP** (upstream failed).\n4. `insight.crm_*` gold views never materialize.\n5. `analytics-api` catalog already advertises the CRM metrics → FE queries → **Code 60 UNKNOWN_TABLE**.\n\n(Two sibling columns from the same era — `archivedAt`, `hs_manual_forecast_category` — have since backfilled into bronze; `hs_created_by_user_id` is the remaining blocker.)\n\n## Fix\n\nAdd `hs_created_by_user_id` to the `deals`, `calls`, `emails`, `meetings`, `tasks` allowlists in `ALLOWED_PROPERTIES_BY_OBJECT`. It's a standard string property, so no `HUBSPOT_TYPE_TO_JSON_SCHEMA` override is needed.\n\n## Post-merge / deploy steps\n\nThis patch removes the root cause but does not materialize data on its own:\n\n1. Deploy the updated connector.\n2. **Full refresh** of the HubSpot `deals` + engagement streams (incremental append won't add a new column to bronze).\n3. dbt run builds `staging.hubspot__crm_*` → `silver.class_crm_*`.\n4. Apply migration `20260512000000_crm-gold-views.sql` → creates `insight.crm_*`.\n\nAfter that the Code 60 errors clear and the three sales dashboard sections render.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n## Release Notes\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added support for the \"created by user ID\" field in HubSpot CRM data ingestion for deals, calls, emails, meetings, and tasks.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/585?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-29T14:31:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T14:33:01Z","closed_at":"2026-05-29T14:33:00Z","merged_at":"2026-05-29T14:33:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"e60cf1f833c6bf02061fb19cb85e3a7f178c687a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/585/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/585/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/585/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/statuses/ee9e863d8b79cf08a6ef88d4b87ba0770900068c","head":{"label":"mitasovr:fix/hubspot-created-by-user-id-property","ref":"fix/hubspot-created-by-user-id-property","sha":"ee9e863d8b79cf08a6ef88d4b87ba0770900068c","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1237641969,"node_id":"R_kgDOScTq8Q","name":"cyber-insight","full_name":"mitasovr/cyber-insight","private":true,"owner":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr/cyber-insight","description":"Cyber Insight defines roles and activities, connects to your systems through ready-to-use connectors (including AI tools), and measures productivity at individual, team, and organization levels. Drill from headline metrics down to source data.","fork":true,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitasovr/cyber-insight","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitasovr/cyber-insight/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitasovr/cyber-insight/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitasovr/cyber-insight/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/r