pdated, builds shine light,\n> From point twenty-seven to eight,\n> Build tags rolling through the gate!\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4574126288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai","html_url":"https://github.com/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"coderabbitai","description":"# Transforming Code Reviews with AI\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n**Automated Reviews**: Continuous reviews of the pull requests including incremental commits. \r\n\r\n**Summarization**: Generates high-level summary and a technical walkthrough of the PR changes. \r\n\r\n**Line-by-line review**: Provides line-by-line suggestions committable with one click.\r\n\r\n**Codebase verification**:  Verifies the impact on the overall codebase and identifies missing changes.\r\n\r\n**Insights into your code**:  Ask any questions on your codebase within the pull request \r\n\r\n**Chat about your code** : Chat with the bot around your code. The more you chat, the smarter it gets.\r\n\r\n**Issue Validation**:  Validates the PR against the linked issues and identifies other related issues \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","external_url":"https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=cr_app&utm_medium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":580,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/580","source_state":"closed","source_author":"Gregory91G","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #580] feat(identity): GET /v1/subchart visible forest + extending org_chart with parent-less rows (#579)","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"feat-identity-subchart-forest-344","pr_head_sha":"3a18e8503a83e6aaf78c38cbc0fde3db57b9a6e1","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"Gregory91G","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/580","id":3767999140,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7glxqk","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/580","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/580.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/580.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/580","number":580,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(identity): GET /v1/subchart visible forest + extending org_chart with parent-less rows (#579)","user":{"login":"Gregory91G","id":17801775,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODAxNzc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17801775?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G","html_url":"https://github.com/Gregory91G","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Migration 012: `org_chart.parent_person_id` → NULLABLE; null-safe `chk_no_self_loop`.\n- `persons-seed` rebuild SQL adds one current-state row per `(tenant, source-instance, person)` that never appears as a child of any edge — true tops + singletons. Active-state filter mirrors the edge rebuild: Inactive persons get historical rows (`valid_to = end of latest active interval`), never current rows.\n- `IPersonsSeedStore.ApplyAsync` accepts `authorPersonId` so the seed operation's author owns the no-parent rows (not pulled from a random source observation).\n- `GET /v1/subchart?depth=N` — forest variant of the single-root subchart. Visibility-bounded per the caller's visible_set (self + org_chart descendants, explicit grants, wildcard expands to all persons in tenant). Singleton orphans filtered at SQL so `depth=0` still returns legit tops with empty `subordinates`.\n\nCloses #579. Follow-up of #344.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Unit suite green (116/116)\n- [x] Integration suite green (125 passed + 2 skipped, 0 failed) — incl. 9 new forest scenarios (self, peer grant, manager grant, wildcard, no source, orphan filter, depth=0, no caller, invalid depth)\n- [x] Live reseed against dev MariaDB: bamboohr 481 edges + 20 no-parent (8 real tops with reports + 12 Active without parent_email); zoom 444 no-parent; 433 Inactive went historical\n- [ ] Live forest endpoint smoke against dev (post-deploy, port-forward 18084)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a forest variant of the subchart API to return multiple org-chart roots with optional depth limiting and visibility-aware results.\n  * Subordinates returned per-root; depth=0 returns tops only.\n\n* **Database / Migration**\n  * Org-chart now supports NULL parents to represent roots and singletons.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * New end-to-end tests covering forest behavior, depth handling, orphan filtering, and error cases.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Clarified behavior and filtering semantics in API docs.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/580?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-29T09:39:36Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T14:44:38Z","closed_at":"2026-05-29T14:44:37Z","merged_at":"2026-05-29T14:44:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"cc4a65d3c23266ec4bc6266d5b0078782f43b115","assignees":[{"login":"Gregory91G","id":17801775,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODAxNzc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17801775?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G","html_url":"https://github.com/Gregory91G","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gregory91G/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"cyberantonz","id":270971350,"node_id":"U_kgDOECax1g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270971350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberantonz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co