.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T09:41:43Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:17:56Z","body":"<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<details>\n<summary>ℹ️ Recent review info</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⚙️ Run configuration</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: defaults\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Free\n\n**Run ID**: `524be392-d8a6-4ce7-8e50-a393180d1bff`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between f8659c1829cab70c86407b0224e27576bd54a738 and 3a18e8503a83e6aaf78c38cbc0fde3db57b9a6e1.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (7)</summary>\n\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Api/Contracts/SubchartNodeResponse.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/IPersonsSeedStore.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/PersonsSeedModels.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/PersonsSeedService.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/Sql.Subchart.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/PersonsSeedEndToEndTests.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Unit/PersonsSeedServiceTests.cs`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚧 Files skipped from review as they are similar to previous changes (3)</summary>\n\n* src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/PersonsSeedService.cs\n* src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/PersonsSeedEndToEndTests.cs\n* src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/Sql.Subchart.cs\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nAdds a multi-root “forest” variant of GET /v1/subchart that returns visibility-filtered root trees, threads authorPersonId through the persons-seed apply pipeline, restructures SQL to emit both edge and NULL-parent root rows, makes parent_person_id nullable, and updates repositories, services, and tests to match.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Org Chart Forest Endpoint and Author Tracking**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|---|---|\n|**Forest Response Contract and Domain Ports** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Api/Contracts/SubchartNodeResponse.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/ISubchartReader.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/SubchartService.cs`|Adds `SubchartForestResponse` DTO, adds `ISubchartReader.GetForestAsync`, and implements `SubchartService.GetForestAsync` to partition flat rows into root trees and build each tree.|\n|**Forest Endpoint Handler** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Api/Endpoints/SubchartEndpoints.cs`|Maps new `GET /v1/subchart` (forest variant): resolves tenant/caller, validates non-negative `depth`, invokes `SubchartService.GetForestAsync`, and returns `SubchartForestResponse` or ProblemResponses for errors.|\n|**Data Access — Forest SQL and Repository Refactor** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/Sql.Subchart.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/SubchartRepository.cs`|Adds `SqlSubchart.GetForest` implementing visible-set → roots → recursive subtree → latest_obs projection and refactors `SubchartRepository` to share `ReadFlatAsync` and expose `GetForestAsync`.|\n|**Seeding SQL and Repository — emit roots and edges with author** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/Sql.PersonsSeed.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/PersonsSeedRepository.cs`|Restructures `InsertOrgChartForTenant` to compute `existing_edges` and `source_member_latest_active` and emit both edge rows and NULL-parent rows; threads `authorPersonId` → `authorBin` into `RebuildOrgChartAsync` and binds `@author_person_id` on inserts.|\n|**Schema Migration — Nullable Parent ID** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/Migrations/012_org_chart_nullable_parent.sql`|Makes `org_chart.parent_person_id` nullable and replaces the self-loop check with a null-safe check to allow explicit root/singleton rows.|\n|**Seed API and Models — author param and counters** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/IPersonsSeedStore.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/PersonsSeedService.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/PersonsSeedModels.cs`|Adds `authorPersonId` parameter to `ApplyAsync`, renames `OrgChartEdgesRebuilt`→`OrgChartRowsRebuilt` in seed result models, and passes `authorPersonId` through `PersonsSeedService`.|\n|**Integration and Unit Tests for Forest and Seeding** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/SubchartEndpointTests.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/PersonsSeedEndToEndTests.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Unit/PersonsSeedServiceTests.cs`|Adds multiple forest-mode integration tests (roots, visibility, orphan filtering, depth handling, error cases), adds helper to insert NULL-parent rows for fixtures, updates end-to-end seed assertions to count edge vs root rows, and adjusts unit test fake to capture `authorPersonId`.|\n\n## Sequence Diagrams\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant Client\n  participant Endpoint as Forest Endpoint\n  participant SubchartService\n  participant SubchartRepository\n  participant Database\n  Client->>Endpoint: GET /v1/subchart?depth=2\n  Endpoint->>Endpoint: resolve tenant & caller\n  Endpoint->>SubchartService: GetForestAsync(tenant, viewer, source, depth)\n  SubchartService->>SubchartRepository: GetForestAsync(...)\n  SubchartRepository->>Database: execute GetForest SQL\n  Database-->>SubchartRepository: flat rows: person_id, parent_id, depth, attrs\n  SubchartRepository-->>SubchartService: IReadOnlyList<SubchartFlatNode>\n  SubchartService->>SubchartService: partition roots & children, build trees\n  SubchartService-->>Endpoint: IReadOnlyList<SubchartNode>\n  Endpoint->>Endpoint: map to SubchartForestResponse\n  Endpoint-->>Client: 200 OK {roots: [...]}\n```\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant PersonsSeedService\n  participant IPersonsSeedStore\n  participant PersonsSeedRepository\n  participant Database\n  PersonsSeedService->>IPersonsSeedStore: ApplyAsync(tenant, author, rows, ct)\n  IPersonsSeedStore->>PersonsSeedRepository: ApplyAsync(tenant, author, rows, ct)\n  PersonsSeedRepository->>PersonsSeedRepository: authorBin = author.ToByteArray()\n  PersonsSeedRepository->>PersonsSeedRepository: RebuildOrgChartAsync(tenantBin, authorBin, ...)\n  PersonsSeedRepository->>Database: InsertOrgChartForTenant(`@tenant_id`, `@author_person_id`, ...)\n  Database->>Database: existing_edges CTE: edges from parent_person_id & parent_email\n  Database->>Database: source_member_latest_active CTE: roots & singleton validity\n  Database->>Database: INSERT edges WHERE parent_person_id NOT NULL\n  Database->>Database: INSERT roots WHERE person_id NOT IN existing_edges AND parent_person_id IS NULL\n  Database-->>PersonsSeedRepository: SeedApplyResult\n  PersonsSeedRepository-->>IPersonsSeedStore: return result\n```\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 4 (Complex) | ⏱️ ~60 minutes\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 Through forests deep of org charts tall,  \n> I hop to trace each root and call,  \n> Authors travel with each seed sown,  \n> Roots now stand where once unknown,  \n> Hooray — the trees at last are shown! 🌿\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4573363483/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai","html_url":"https://github.com/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"coderabbitai","description":"# Tran