6.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/576.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/576","number":576,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Revert \"feat(identity): return caller's accessible org forest from GET /v1/persons (#571)\"","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Reverts #571.\n\nRolls back the accessible-forest change on `GET /v1/persons/{email}` — the endpoint returns to its previous behavior (single-person lookup by email with the per-target visibility gate). This is a clean revert of the #571 squash commit (`1837f92`): production code, the SQL/reader additions, and the test changes all reverted, including removal of `PersonForestTests`.\n\n## Scope\n- Reverts **only** the code PR #571.\n- Does **not** touch the helm release bump (#572, chart `0.1.25`). The deployed identity image still points at the forest build until a fresh release is cut — a new release will be made separately.\n\n## Follow-up\n- New identity release to be built/published after this revert lands.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n## Release Notes\n\n* **Deprecations**\n  * The GET /v1/persons/{email} endpoint is now deprecated. Applications should migrate to POST /v1/profiles for person profile resolution.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Enhanced visibility permission validation in identity lookups for improved security and consistency across operations.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/576?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-29T08:11:57Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T08:14:23Z","closed_at":"2026-05-29T08:14:23Z","merged_at":"2026-05-29T08:14:23Z","merge_commit_sha":"d67a76ffe1c180ad039fcb4b116e82f35dcf82c8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/576/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/576/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/576/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/statuses/ccec52106d6271dbaf79b6845dcf41fa72c0b356","head":{"label":"mitasovr:revert-571-identity-forest","ref":"revert-571-identity-forest","sha":"ccec52106d6271dbaf79b6845dcf41fa72c0b356","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://gith