on":null},"source_issue_comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4572459960","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/576#issuecomment-4572459960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/576","id":4572459960,"node_id":"IC_kwDORRWv8s8AAAABEIozuA","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T08:12:49Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T08:13:59Z","body":"<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<details>\n<summary>ℹ️ Recent review info</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⚙️ Run configuration</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: defaults\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Free\n\n**Run ID**: `80ad3f61-935d-4429-882e-880ac3778a6d`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between db9be4b5b083a1e910d204b5a90afe27779544fa and ccec52106d6271dbaf79b6845dcf41fa72c0b356.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (14)</summary>\n\n* `src/backend/services/identity/seed/seed-persons.sh`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Api/Endpoints/PersonsEndpoints.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/IPersonsReader.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/PersonLookupService.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/PersonsRepository.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/Sql.OrgChart.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/JwtCallerResolveTests.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/OrgTreeEndpointTests.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/OrgTreeLookupTests.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/PersonsEndpointTests.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/VisibilityGateTests.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Unit/HeaderCallerContextTests.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Unit/PersonForestTests.cs`\n* `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Unit/ProfileLookupServiceTests.cs`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>💤 Files with no reviewable changes (5)</summary>\n\n* src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Unit/PersonForestTests.cs\n* src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/IPersonsReader.cs\n* src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Unit/HeaderCallerContextTests.cs\n* src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/PersonsRepository.cs\n* src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/Sql.OrgChart.cs\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nThis PR removes the forest-based visibility expansion from PersonLookupService and refactors the `/v1/persons/{email}` endpoint to use direct person lookup with an explicit visibility gate. The endpoint is marked deprecated and returns uniform 404 for both missing and invisible persons. All integration and unit tests are updated to seed explicit visibility grants instead of relying on forest logic.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Visibility Refactoring**\n\n| Layer / File(s) | Summary |\n|---|---|\n| **Service layer: remove forest and root-lookup capability** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/PersonLookupService.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Domain/Services/IPersonsReader.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/PersonsRepository.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Infrastructure/MariaDb/Sql.OrgChart.cs` | PersonLookupService constructor no longer takes IVisibilityReader; GetVisibleForestAsync public method and its cycle-detection helpers removed; IPersonsReader removes GetRootPersonIdsAsync declaration; PersonsRepository removes GetRootPersonIdsAsync implementation; Sql.OrgChart removes RootPersonsForTenant query constant. |\n| **Endpoint: deprecation headers and explicit visibility gate** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/src/Insight.Identity.Api/Endpoints/PersonsEndpoints.cs` | GET /v1/persons/{email} sets Deprecation and Link headers pointing to POST /v1/profiles; replaces forest-based lookup with direct GetByEmailAsync; adds explicit CanSeeAsync visibility check; returns uniform 404 for missing and invisible persons. |\n| **Integration test visibility setup: replace forest logic with explicit seeding** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/JwtCallerResolveTests.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/PersonsEndpointTests.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/OrgTreeLookupTests.cs` | JwtCallerResolveTests and PersonsEndpointTests now seed whole-tenant visibility for test callers instead of relying on email observations; OrgTreeLookupTests simplifies PersonLookupService wiring by removing VisibilityRepository dependency. |\n| **Endpoint tests: validate deprecation headers and factory consolidation** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/OrgTreeEndpointTests.cs` | Consolidates per-test factory creation into shared _app instance; Alice test asserts Deprecation and Link headers with rel=\"successor-version\"; Bob expand_subordinates test switches defaultCallerPersonId to CallerPersonId. |\n| **Visibility gate tests: rewrite for status-code assertions** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Integration/VisibilityGateTests.cs` | Refactored from forest-email-content validation to HTTP status-code assertions (200 OK vs 404 NotFound); self-lookup, whole-tenant grant, subtree grant, org-chart descent, no-grant, revoked-grant, and cross-tenant tests now assert correct endpoint response codes for visible/invisible targets. |\n| **Unit tests: remove forest test file and visibility stubs** <br> `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Unit/HeaderCallerContextTests.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Unit/ProfileLookupServiceTests.cs`, `src/backend/services/identity/tests/Insight.Identity.Tests.Unit/PersonForestTests.cs` | PersonForestTests file removed (216 lines); HeaderCallerContextTests removes GetRootPersonIdsAsync stubs; ProfileLookupServiceTests removes NoVisibilityReader test double and updates all PersonLookupService instantiation to drop visibility parameter. |\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 4 (Complex) | ⏱️ ~45 minutes\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 *A forest grows, then fades away,*  \n> *The lookup finds a cleaner way,*  \n> *One person, one direct appeal,*  \n> *A gate that checks what's truly real,*  \n> *404 speaks in honest tongue—*  \n> *The refactoring dance, sung and sung!* 🌿\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4572459960/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai","html_url":"https://github.com/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"coderabbitai","description":"# Transforming Code Reviews with AI\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n**Automated Reviews**: Continuous reviews of the pull requests including incremental commits. \r\n\r\n**Summarization**: Generates high-level summary and a technical walkthrough of the PR changes. \r\n\r\n**Line-by-line review**: Provides line-by-line suggestions committable with one click.\r\n\r\n**Codebase verification**:  Verifies the impact on the overall codebase and identifies missing changes.\r\n\r\n**Insights into your code**:  Ask any questions on your codebase within the pull request \r\n\r\n**Chat about your code** : Chat with the bot around your code. The more you chat, the smarter it gets.\r\n\r\n**Issue Validation**:  Validates the PR against the linked issues and identifies other related issues \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","external_url":"https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=cr_app&utm_medium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":575,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/575","source_state":"closed","source_author":"mitasovr","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #575] chore(release): umbrella 0.1.26 (per-connector dbt selector + toolbox/front rebuild)","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"chore-release-0.1.26","pr_head_sha":"28766be405aa5637368496f6c2039f17b44cfc23","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"mitasovr","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/575","id":3767331686,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7gjOtm","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/575","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/575.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/575.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/575","number":575,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(release): umbrella 0.1.26 (per-connector dbt selector + toolbox/front rebuild)","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\nManual replay release (CI image builds still halted) shipping the **per-connector dbt selector** fix to the cluster, plus a freshly built toolbox and frontend image.\n\n- **Per-connector dbt scoping** (#574, already merged to `main`): `transform-legacy` derives its dbt selector from the connector slug as `tag:<connector>+`, so one connector's missing/stale bronze can no longer fail every connector's transform. This release bumps the umbrella so the cluster picks up the fixed `ingestion-pipeline` WorkflowTemplate.\n- **Toolbox image** rebuilt (amd64, native on the build host from `main` @ `babfb7c`) and pushed:\n  `ghcr.io/cyberfabric/insight-toolbox:2026.05.29.07.28-babfb7c`\n- **Frontend image**: `2026.05.29.07.18-9f98d7c`\n\n## Bumps\n- `charts/insight/Chart.yaml` — `version 0.1.25 → 0.1.26`, `appVersion` → max subchart tag (`2026.05.29.07.18-9f98d7c`)\n- `charts/insight/values.yaml` — `ingestion.toolboxImage` → `2026.05.29.07.28-babfb7c`\n- `src/frontend/helm/Chart.yaml` — `appVersion` → `2026.05.29.07.18-9f98d7c`\n- `docs/deploy/.insight-version` — `0.1.25 → 0.1.26`\n\n## Notes\n- Other subcharts (api-gateway / analytics-api / identity) keep their current appVersions — those images are unchanged.\n- `Chart.lock` is intentionally untouched — the `dependencies:` set did not change, so its digest stays valid.\n- Both referenced images were verified to exist in GHCR.\n- The umbrella chart is **not** pushed to OCI in this PR.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Bumped release version and updated all associated deployment configurations to the latest build.\n  * Updated container image tags to reflect current release versions across deployment components.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/575?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-29T07:40:00Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T07:40:43Z","closed_at":"2026-05-29T07:40:43Z","merge