fabric/cyber-insight/pull/574#issuecomment-4571909470","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/574","id":4571909470,"node_id":"IC_kwDORRWv8s8AAAABEIHNXg","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T07:12:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T07:12:59Z","body":"<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<details>\n<summary>ℹ️ Recent review info</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⚙️ Run configuration</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: defaults\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Free\n\n**Run ID**: `384f3711-1798-438b-812d-5d492791baa9`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between a61516040d5c3dc734ecf8e2c6ab37c8aea78e52 and 7af1ef9c3e847e5ebad7fbd0a86b63bdf705b34a.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (1)</summary>\n\n* `charts/insight/templates/ingestion/ingestion-pipeline.yaml`\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nThe Helm template for the ingestion pipeline's non-Jira legacy flow was updated to enforce dbt selection scoping via the connector slug. Documentation comments now explain this explicit scoping behavior, and the `transform-legacy` task parameter was changed to generate tag-based selection from `data_source` instead of accepting the caller's `dbt_select`.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Non-Jira Legacy Transform Scoping**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|---|---|\n|**Legacy dbt selection scoping from connector slug** <br> `charts/insight/templates/ingestion/ingestion-pipeline.yaml`|Documentation for the non-Jira path is updated to describe name-derived dbt scoping by connector slug and intentional discard of incoming `dbt_select`. The `transform-legacy` task's `dbt_select` parameter now generates `tag:{{inputs.parameters.data_source}}+` instead of using the provided value.|\n\n🎯 2 (Simple) | ⏱️ ~8 minutes\n\n> 🐰 A connector slug now scopes the dbt magic,  \n> No more mixed selections, the change isn't tragic,  \n> Legacy transforms aligned to their name,  \n> Tags bloom from data_source—the pipeline's new game! ✨\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4571909470/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai","html_url":"https://github.com/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"coderabbitai","description":"# Transforming Code Reviews with AI\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n**Automated Reviews**: Continuous reviews of the pull requests including incremental commits. \r\n\r\n**Summarization**: Generates high-level summary and a technical walkthrough of the PR changes. \r\n\r\n**Line-by-line review**: Provides line-by-line suggestions committable with one click.\r\n\r\n**Codebase verification**:  Verifies the impact on the overall codebase and identifies missing changes.\r\n\r\n**Insights into your code**:  Ask any questions on your codebase within the pull request \r\n\r\n**Chat about your code** : Chat with the bot around your code. The more you chat, the smarter it gets.\r\n\r\n**Issue Validation**:  Validates the PR against the linked issues and identifies other related issues \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","external_url":"https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=cr_app&utm_medium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":573,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/573","source_state":"closed","source_author":"mitasovr","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #573] fix(reconcile): align ClickHouse destination + connector CronWorkflow with Airbyte 2.x / Argo 3.5","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"claude/mystifying-fermi-86cbb0","pr_head_sha":"68d89797daeb653436c057e59c4e39ef0567e58e","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"mitasovr","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/573","id":3767177365,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7gipCV","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/573","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/573.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/573.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/573","number":573,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(reconcile): align ClickHouse destination + connector CronWorkflow with Airbyte 2.x / Argo 3.5","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nThe reconcile **create** path was never exercised on the bundled-Airbyte topology — the legacy cluster adopted pre-existing Airbyte resources by name, so the create code was dormant. On a fresh namespace it runs for real and hit three latent incompatibilities. Fixes:\n\n- **ClickHouse destination config → 2.x schema.** `airbyte/destination-clickhouse` 2.x (Bulk-CDK) rewrote its config schema: `port` is now a **string**, `protocol` (`http|https`) is **required**, and the legacy `ssl`/`schema` keys are rejected with a `422`. `reconcile.sh` now builds the connectionConfiguration accordingly. The chart injects a new `RECONCILE_DEST_CLICKHOUSE_PROTOCOL` via an `insight.clickhouse.protocol` helper (default `http`, matching the bundled plain-HTTP ClickHouse on 8123 and the existing `insight.clickhouse.url` helper).\n- **Per-connector Argo CronWorkflow → `schedules[]`.** `templates/cron-workflow.yaml.tpl` still used singular `spec.schedule`, rejected by the Argo Workflows ≥3.5 CRD (`unknown field \"spec.schedule\"`). Switched to the `schedules:` array — the same fix already applied to the chart's `reconcile-cron.yaml` in #549.\n- **Loud destination errors.** `ab_ensure_destination` piped the create response straight into a parser, turning any non-2xx into an opaque `KeyError: 'destinationId'`. It now captures the response and surfaces the Airbyte error body (which names the offending config field).\n\n## Test plan\n\nVerified end-to-end against a live bundled Airbyte (2.x destination-clickhouse, Argo 4.x):\n\n- [x] ClickHouse destination created with the corrected 2.x config (no 422)\n- [x] connector source + connection reconciled to **active**\n- [x] per-connector sync CronWorkflow applies (`schedules[]`, server dry-run + live create)\n- [x] `reconcile` reports **0 errors** on a clean run (vs. `1 error` on the pre-fix image)\n- [x] `bash -n` on changed shell libs\n\n> Note: chart version bump and the `insight-toolbox` image rebuild are handled separately (out of scope for this PR).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added configurable ClickHouse protocol selection (http/https support).\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved error messaging for Airbyte destination creation failures.\n  * Updated CronWorkflow template for compatibility with Argo Workflows >=3.5.\n  * Enhanced configuration compatibility with destination-clickhouse 2.x.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/573?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-29T07:11:54Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T07:13:18Z","closed_at":"2026-05-29T07:13:17Z","merged_at":"2026-05-29T07:13:17Z","merge_commit_sha":"298c6105797e96b580d0617713c355ba5a3a71d4","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_tea