s://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T07:12:02Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T07:12:40Z","body":"<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<details>\n<summary>ℹ️ Recent review info</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⚙️ Run configuration</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: defaults\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Free\n\n**Run ID**: `2d9f29bc-4424-4320-bb96-f76c1f292045`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between a61516040d5c3dc734ecf8e2c6ab37c8aea78e52 and 68d89797daeb653436c057e59c4e39ef0567e58e.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (6)</summary>\n\n* `charts/insight/templates/_helpers.tpl`\n* `charts/insight/templates/ingestion/reconcile-cron.yaml`\n* `charts/insight/values.yaml`\n* `src/ingestion/reconcile-connectors/lib/airbyte.sh`\n* `src/ingestion/reconcile-connectors/lib/reconcile.sh`\n* `src/ingestion/reconcile-connectors/templates/cron-workflow.yaml.tpl`\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nThis PR migrates ClickHouse destination configuration from 1.x to 2.x schema, adding protocol support and improving error diagnostics. It updates Helm helpers to route the protocol setting, modifies reconciliation logic to generate 2.x-compatible configuration, enhances Airbyte error handling, and upgrades CronWorkflow to the newer Argo API.\n\n## Changes\n\n**ClickHouse 2.x Schema Upgrade**\n\n| Layer / File(s) | Summary |\n|---|---|\n| **Helm protocol configuration and routing** <br> `charts/insight/templates/_helpers.tpl`, `charts/insight/values.yaml`, `charts/insight/templates/ingestion/reconcile-cron.yaml` | Introduces `insight.clickhouse.protocol` helper (defaulting to `http`), adds the configuration value, and routes it through the reconcile CronWorkflow as the `RECONCILE_DEST_CLICKHOUSE_PROTOCOL` environment variable. |\n| **Reconciliation destination bootstrap and error handling** <br> `src/ingestion/reconcile-connectors/lib/reconcile.sh`, `src/ingestion/reconcile-connectors/lib/airbyte.sh` | Replaces destination config JSON with 2.x schema (protocol instead of legacy ssl/schema, port as string), and adds explicit error capture and reporting when Airbyte destination creation fails, including the full response body. |\n| **Argo CronWorkflow API upgrade** <br> `src/ingestion/reconcile-connectors/templates/cron-workflow.yaml.tpl` | Migrates from legacy `spec.schedule` to the newer `spec.schedules` array to support Argo Workflows >=3.5. |\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 3 (Moderate) | ⏱️ ~20 minutes\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 A protocol springs forth in helm,  \n> From `http` waves, our logs o'erwhelm,  \n> The bunny hops through Argo's time,  \n> Where schemas sync in 2.x rhyme!\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4571903106/reactions","total_c