/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\nManual replay build (CI image builds still halted) shipping the identity **accessible-forest** change from #571 to the cluster.\n\n- Built `insight-identity` natively (amd64) on the build host and pushed:\n  `ghcr.io/cyberfabric/insight-identity:2026.05.28.19.41-46ce054`\n- Bumps the identity subchart appVersion to that tag and patch-bumps the umbrella.\n\n## Bumps\n- `src/backend/services/identity/helm/Chart.yaml` — `appVersion` → `2026.05.28.19.41-46ce054`\n- `charts/insight/Chart.yaml` — `version 0.1.24 → 0.1.25`, `appVersion` → max subchart tag (`2026.05.28.19.41-46ce054`)\n- `docs/deploy/.insight-version` — `0.1.24 → 0.1.25`\n\n## Notes\n- Other subcharts (api-gateway / analytics-api / frontend / toolbox) keep their current appVersions — those images are unchanged.\n- `Chart.lock` is intentionally untouched — the `dependencies:` set did not change, so its digest stays valid.\n- The umbrella chart is **not** pushed to OCI in this PR.\n- Depends on code PR #571 (the image was built from that branch @ `46ce054`).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated product version to 0.1.25 with backend service updates.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[!