toolbox with CH 25.3 dbt fix #565)","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nBumps `ingestion.toolboxImage` to a toolbox built **after #565** (the `FINAL`-must-follow-alias fix for zoom/zulip collab dbt models on ClickHouse 25.3). Releases umbrella **0.1.22**.\n\n## Why\n\n#565 fixed the dbt models in source, but the deployed `toolboxImage` (`...9678418`) still carries the broken models. reconcile-loop and `dbt-run` on a ClickHouse 25.3 cluster execute dbt **from the toolbox image** — so without bumping the image, the next incremental run rebuilds `silver.class_collab_meeting_activity` through the old (broken) toolbox, `zoom__collab_meeting_activity` fails again, and the `gold-views` migration skips `insight.exec_summary` / `team_member` / `*_company_stats` (the main summary dashboards).\n\nSurfaced on the virtuozzo cluster (bundled ClickHouse 25.3).\n\n## Image\n\n- `ghcr.io/cyberfabric/insight-toolbox:2026.05.27.16.00-b96a83d` (amd64, built on host after #565 merged).\n\nNo other images changed — analytics-api / identity / frontend / api-gateway keep their 0.1.21 appVersions.\n\nUmbrella chart packaged + pushed to `oci://ghcr.io/cyberfabric/charts/insight:0.1.22`.\n\n## Chart bumps\n\n- `charts/insight/values.yaml`: `ingestion.toolboxImage` → new tag\n- `charts/insight/Chart.yaml`: version `0.1.21 → 0.1.22`, appVersion → `2026.05.27.16.00-b96a83d`\n- `docs/deploy/.insight-version`: `0.1.21 → 0.1.22`\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] `helm pull ...:0.1.22` → toolboxImage = `...b96a83d`. ✅ verified post-push.\n- [ ] reconcile-loop tick on CH 25.3 rebuilds `silver.class_collab_meeting_activity` cleanly.\n- [ ] gold-views stay intact after incremental dbt.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated chart version to 0.1.22 with latest application version alignment.\n  * Updated deployment toolbox image to latest version.\n  * Updated deployment documentation version reference.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/566?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-27T12:13:53Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T12:14:53Z","closed_at":"2026-05-27T12:14:53Z","merged_at":"2026-05-27T12:14:53Z","merge_commit_sha":"45a61a7e173709cf933e68cc918505cf29e4d7a7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/566/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/566/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url"