criptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"coderabbitai","description":"# Transforming Code Reviews with AI\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n**Automated Reviews**: Continuous reviews of the pull requests including incremental commits. \r\n\r\n**Summarization**: Generates high-level summary and a technical walkthrough of the PR changes. \r\n\r\n**Line-by-line review**: Provides line-by-line suggestions committable with one click.\r\n\r\n**Codebase verification**:  Verifies the impact on the overall codebase and identifies missing changes.\r\n\r\n**Insights into your code**:  Ask any questions on your codebase within the pull request \r\n\r\n**Chat about your code** : Chat with the bot around your code. The more you chat, the smarter it gets.\r\n\r\n**Issue Validation**:  Validates the PR against the linked issues and identifies other related issues \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","external_url":"https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=cr_app&utm_medium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}}],"source_review_comments":[],"source_reviews":[]},{"source_pr_number":561,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/561","source_state":"closed","source_author":"cyberantonz","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #561] feat(analytics-api): single-tenant tenantDefaultId fallback (Refs #522)","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"metrics-catalog","pr_head_sha":"b439de50c56f0858ab7008eb869403359dc59bf4","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"cyberantonz","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/561","id":3754128826,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7fw3W6","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/561","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/561.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/561.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/561","number":561,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(analytics-api): single-tenant tenantDefaultId fallback (Refs #522)","user":{"login":"cyberantonz","id":270971350,"node_id":"U_kgDOECax1g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270971350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberantonz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds the Metric Catalog auth-trait `TenantAuthorization` with the `resolve_tenant(session) -> Option<TenantId>` contract per DESIGN §3.2 and the single-tenant fallback constraint\r\n`cpt-metric-cat-constraint-tenant-default` (DESIGN §2.2). Operators set `ANALYTICS__metric_catalog__tenant_default_id` (umbrella value `analyticsApi.tenantDefaultId`) for single-tenant installs; multi-tenant installs leave it unset and tenant-less requests are rejected with a canonical `invalid_argument` envelope carrying\r\n`field_violations[{field:\"tenant_id\", reason:\"TENANT_UNRESOLVED\"}]`.\r\n\r\nMirrors the identity-resolution analogue\r\n(`src/backend/services/identity/.../ConfigTenantContext.cs` + `HeaderTenantContext.cs`) so operators see the same single-tenant ergonomic across Insight services. The session-bound tenant ALWAYS wins over the configured default (security invariant — a regression here is a privilege-escalation bug); both the unit test\r\n`session_wins_over_configured_default` and the integration test of the same name in `tenant_resolution_tests` pin that contract.\r\n\r\nDefense in depth on top of the contract:\r\n- the header path rejects `Uuid::nil()` (mirrors identity's `HeaderTenantContext.Resolve` nil check),\r\n- `ConfigTenantAuthorization::new` also filters `Some(Uuid::nil())` out of the configured default so a misconfigured Helm value cannot pin a zero tenant either,\r\n- multi-valued `X-Insight-Tenant-Id` headers are refused to close a smuggling vector.\r\n\r\nEnd-to-end coverage against a live analytics-api with a real DB is tracked separately in #558.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added configurable tenant default ID for Analytics API to support single-tenant fallback behavior\n  * Implemented tenant resolution middleware with clear precedence: session tenant → configured default → error response\n  * Enhanced error handling with RFC 9457-compliant structured errors when tenant cannot be resolved\n  * Added comprehensive test coverage for tenant resolution scenarios\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/561?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-27T09:32:24Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T10:43:43Z","closed_at":"2026-05-27T10:43:43Z","merged_at":"2026-05-27T10:43:42Z","merge_commit_sha":"90d9a2e929d43373a2385d753dd1e55567fcc8b5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/561/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/561/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/561/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/statuses/b439de50c56f0858ab7008eb869403359dc59bf4","head":{"label":"cyberantonz:metrics-catalog","ref":"metrics-catalog","sha":"b439de50c56f0858ab7008eb869403359dc59bf4","user":{"login":"cyberantonz","id":270971350,"node_id":"U_kgDOECax1g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270971350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberantonz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyberantonz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/c