bbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T07:09:53Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T07:15:47Z","body":"<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: failure by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> ## Review failed\n> \n> The pull request is closed.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: failure by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>ℹ️ Recent review info</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>⚙️ Run configuration</summary>\n\n**Configuration used**: defaults\n\n**Review profile**: CHILL\n\n**Plan**: Free\n\n**Run ID**: `5bc9a2c9-8946-49ec-870e-9c117121fa22`\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📥 Commits</summary>\n\nReviewing files that changed from the base of the PR and between 24e2bb8bfc211d1f3d242774ada2b5baa1de8641 and 61d55a64655c2eca452309c89d789360f3bcadc2.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>📒 Files selected for processing (1)</summary>\n\n* `src/ingestion/reconcile-connectors/lib/reconcile.sh`\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nThis PR adds a Claude Team Airbyte connector and supporting artifacts to ingest four Bronze streams (members, invites, overage spend, code metrics) via a customer-hosted proxy, plus documentation, dbt staging/promotion models, descriptor/secret examples, and minor reconcile/silver schema updates.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Claude Team Connector**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|---|---|\n|**Requirements and Design Specifications** <br> `docs/components/connectors/ai/claude-team/specs/PRD.md`, `docs/components/connectors/ai/claude-team/specs/DESIGN.md`, `docs/components/connectors/ai/claude-team/specs/FEATURE.md`|PRD/Design/Feature docs define architecture (customer proxy sessionKey boundary), stream contracts (endpoints, keys, pagination, cursor/backfill semantics), error mappings (403→empty, 401→fail), validation commands, and operational limits.|\n|**Operational Documentation and Setup** <br> `src/ingestion/connectors/ai/claude-team/README.md`|README documents the proxy authentication model, required Kubernetes Secret fields (`claude_org_id`, `proxy_url`, `proxy_auth_token`, optional `start_date`), record enrichment fields, stream endpoints and sync behaviors, and validation examples.|\n|**Declarative Connector Implementation** <br> `src/ingestion/connectors/ai/claude-team/connector.yaml`|Airbyte DeclarativeSource (v7.0.4) adding four streams: `claude_team_members` and `claude_team_invites` (full snapshots, root-array extraction), `claude_team_overage_spend` (PageIncrement, envelope `items`, HTTP 403 → handled as empty stream), and `claude_team_code_metrics` (OffsetIncrement per-request pagination + DatetimeBasedCursor incremental per-day backfill, inclusive-day params, `metric_date` injected). All streams enrich records with Insight metadata and enable `autoImportSchema`.|\n|**Connector Metadata and Kubernetes Secrets** <br> `src/ingestion/connectors/ai/claude-team/descriptor.yaml`, `src/ingestion/secrets/connectors/claude-team.yaml.example`|Connector descriptor (version 1.2.0, daily 04:00 UTC, `bronze_claude_team` namespace, `dbt_select` tag) and K8s Secret example template with placeholders and notes that `sessionKey` is managed by the customer proxy and not stored in the Secret.|\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant Insight as Insight Scheduler\n  participant Airbyte as Airbyte Declarative Source\n  participant Proxy as Customer Proxy\n  participant ClaudeAPI as claude.ai API\n  Insight->>Airbyte: trigger daily sync\n  Airbyte->>Proxy: proxy request (Bearer proxy_auth_token)\n  Proxy->>ClaudeAPI: forward with sessionKey cookie\n  ClaudeAPI-->>Proxy: JSON response / 403\n  Proxy-->>Airbyte: JSON response or mapped-empty (403)\n  Airbyte->>Airbyte: paginate/cursor, inject metric_date, enrich metadata\n  Airbyte-->>Insight: emit Bronze records\n```\n\n🎯 4 (Complex) | ⏱️ ~45 minutes\n\n> 🐰 Four streams now flowing, nested secrets kept tight,  \n> Proxy keeps sessionKey hidden through the night.  \n> Metric dates injected, 403s forgiven with care,  \n> Bronze lands each day — dbt readies promotion there! 🥕\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> <details>\n> <summary>🎁 Summarized by CodeRabbit Free</summary>\n> \n> Your organization is on the Free plan. CodeRabbit will generate a high-level summary and a walkthrough for each pull request. For a comprehensive line-by-line review, please upgrade your subscription to CodeRabbit Pro by visiting <https://app.coderabbit.ai/login>.\n> \n> </details>\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/comments/4552268304/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai","html_url":"https://github.com/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code