:"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"claude/release-umbrella-bump","pr_head_sha":"1c52337f8d1116245f2c501eacd167b09eab883b","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"mitasovr","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/559","id":3750772533,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7fkD81","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/559","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/559.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/559.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/559","number":559,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(release): umbrella 0.1.20 (build 2026.05.26.19.56-9678418)","user":{"login":"mitasovr","id":370538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDUzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/370538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr","html_url":"https://github.com/mitasovr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitasovr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nManual release of umbrella **0.1.20** from current `main` (@ `9678418`). Replaces 0.1.19, which was built from `d86ba20` — a commit that predates the reconcile-cron `schedules[]` fix (#549). 0.1.20 ships that fix so `ingestion.templates.enabled=true` works on clusters with the Argo ≥3.5 CRD.\n\nThis mirrors the manual-replay flow of `7e63f779` (umbrella 0.1.19) because automated CI image builds remain halted by the GitHub Actions billing guard.\n\n## Images rebuilt + pushed\n\n| Image | Tag |\n|---|---|\n| `insight-analytics-api` | `2026.05.26.19.56-9678418` (+ latest) |\n| `insight-identity` | `2026.05.26.19.56-9678418` (+ latest) |\n| `insight-toolbox` | `2026.05.26.19.56-9678418` (+ latest) |\n| `cyber-insight-front` | `2026.05.26.19.57-28519bf` (+ latest) |\n\n`api-gateway` was **not** rebuilt — unchanged source, its subchart appVersion stays at `2026.05.20.16.41-a5a9495` (existing image).\n\nUmbrella chart packaged + pushed to `oci://ghcr.io/cyberfabric/charts/insight:0.1.20`.\n\n## Chart bumps\n\n- `charts/insight/Chart.yaml`: version `0.1.19 → 0.1.20`, appVersion → `2026.05.26.19.56-9678418` (display-only max)\n- `charts/insight/values.yaml`: `ingestion.toolboxImage` → new tag\n- `src/backend/services/analytics-api/helm/Chart.yaml`: appVersion → new tag\n- `src/backend/services/identity/helm/Chart.yaml`: appVersion → new tag\n- `src/frontend/helm/Chart.yaml`: appVersion → frontend tag\n- `docs/deploy/.insight-version`: `0.1.19 → 0.1.20`\n\n## ⚠️ Two source-side build breakages worked around (need separate fix PRs)\n\nTo produce the images from current `main`, two breakages were bypassed locally:\n\n1. **analytics-api**: `Dockerfile` pins `rust:1.92-bookworm`, but dependency `cf-modkit-canonical-errors@0.7.3` (RFC 9457 envelope, adopted in main) requires `rustc 1.95`. Built with `rust:1.95-bookworm`. → Dockerfile toolchain bump needed.\n2. **frontend**: build script `tsc -b && vite build` fails on a clean checkout — `routeTree.gen.ts` (gitignored) is generated by the `tanstackRouter` vite plugin only at vite `buildStart`, so `tsc` runs first and fails. Built with `vite build` directly. → build-script ordering / pre-generate step needed.\n\nBoth are part of the same CI-breakage window (since 2026-05-25).\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] `helm pull oci://ghcr.io/cyberfabric/charts/insight --version 0.1.20` → `reconcile-cron.yaml` renders `schedules:` (array). ✅ verified post-push.\n- [ ] Deploy to a cluster with Argo ≥3.5 CRD + `ingestion.templates.enabled=true` → `insight-reconcile-loop` CronWorkflow applies without `.spec.schedule` schema rejection.\n- [ ] reconcile-loop ticks, populates Airbyte sources/destinations/connections.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated application version and deployment configuration across services\n  * Refreshed container image tags for backend and frontend components\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/559?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-26T20:25:28Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T20:26:58Z","closed_at":"2026-05-26T20:26:57Z","merged_at":"2026-05-26T20:26:57Z","merge_commit_sha":"cfb2cfadf3106c7636503c786ce785b806651b2b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/559/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/559/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/559/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/statuses/1c52337f8d1116245f2c501eacd167b09eab883b","head":{"label":"mitasovr:claude/release-umbrella-bump",