columns","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"fix/metric-threshold-not-null","pr_head_sha":"3302c80b13ee7b3be42bd215d10412989c42f834","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"cyberfabric","pr_from_fork":0,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/557","id":3748994888,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRWv8s7fdR9I","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/557","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/557.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/557.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/557","number":557,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(analytics-api): drop invalid NOT NULL on generated columns","user":{"login":"aleksdotbar","id":52774564,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzc0NTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52774564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksdotbar","html_url":"https://github.com/aleksdotbar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksdotbar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksdotbar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksdotbar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksdotbar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksdotbar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksdotbar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksdotbar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksdotbar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksdotbar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"MariaDB's [generated-column syntax](https://mariadb.com/kb/en/generated-columns/) does not accept `NOT NULL`. `m20260522_000002_metric_threshold` uses MySQL-flavoured `STORED NOT NULL` on two `GENERATED ALWAYS AS (...)` columns and fails at init against MariaDB 11.4:\n\n```\n1064 (42000): You have an error in your SQL syntax;\ncheck the manual that corresponds to your MariaDB server version\nfor the right syntax to use near 'NOT NULL' at line 1\n```\n\nPod stays in `Init:Error`, rollout never completes.\n\nRuntime non-null behaviour is preserved without the keyword: `COALESCE(tenant_id, 0x00…)` and `is_locked` (already `NOT NULL`) cannot produce NULL, and MariaDB substitutes the expression's value if NULL is written to a PERSISTENT generated column.\n\nRefs #519\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Adjusted a database schema migration to relax specific column constraints, improving schema flexibility and future migrations. No user-facing behavior or data access changes are expected.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pull/557?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-05-26T14:58:00Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T15:24:44Z","closed_at":"2026-05-26T15:24:43Z","merged_at":"2026-05-26T15:24:43Z","merge_commit_sha":"96784184660345773eea313aa82b757b6591f19e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/557/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/557/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyber-insight/issues/557/comments","statuses_